WEBVTT

00:01.330 --> 00:03.480
Could she be Princess Flora?

00:04.220 --> 00:06.480
I can't believe I'd run into her here.

00:12.550 --> 00:14.160
Master Rio?

00:14.160 --> 00:19.310
Thank you for saving us
from this predicament.

00:19.310 --> 00:22.690
My name is Liselotte Cretia.

00:22.690 --> 00:25.050
I am the governor of Amande.

00:25.410 --> 00:27.130
My name is Haruto.

00:27.130 --> 00:28.370
Haruto...

00:28.370 --> 00:32.820
Master Haruto, this is the second
princess of Beltrum Kingdom,

00:32.820 --> 00:35.030
Her Highness Princess Flora.

00:35.030 --> 00:37.940
And the current head
of the Dukedom of Huguenot,

00:37.940 --> 00:39.140
Duke Gustav Huguenot.

00:41.470 --> 00:43.910
Your Highness, what's wrong?

00:43.910 --> 00:44.550
Huh?

00:46.090 --> 00:50.250
If I may, have I been rude to you?

00:50.250 --> 00:52.070
No, you haven't.

00:52.070 --> 00:53.370
Um...

00:54.220 --> 00:57.000
Have we met somewhere before?

00:57.000 --> 01:00.500
Are you talking about my meeting
you before, Your Highness?

01:00.500 --> 01:02.880
I don't recall us ever meeting, though.

01:03.260 --> 01:05.220
I see...

01:05.220 --> 01:08.170
If Princess Flora says she's met you before,

01:08.170 --> 01:11.630
then you might be a noble of a country?

01:11.630 --> 01:13.010
Or rather...

01:13.010 --> 01:18.820
No, I'm just a traveller of many nations,
going about places while training.

01:19.350 --> 01:22.980
I'm not one to be blessed
with ever meeting a royal.

01:23.520 --> 01:24.490
Huh...

01:24.870 --> 01:29.550
I can't believe such a skilled swordsman
like you wouldn't belong to any nation...

01:48.000 --> 01:50.550
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

02:50.880 --> 02:54.700
I borrowed Miharu's uniform.
Now I look pure, don't I?

02:55.380 --> 02:56.690
What do you think?

02:57.240 --> 02:58.990
It looks great on you!

03:01.200 --> 03:01.910
THE WEDGE OF MEMORIES

03:01.910 --> 03:03.430
THE WEDGE OF MEMORIES
Master Haruto?

03:04.210 --> 03:07.370
I knew it, it's you!

03:07.370 --> 03:08.560
You are...

03:08.560 --> 03:13.470
I'm Chloe, your guide during your
visit at Amande's Ricca Guild!

03:13.830 --> 03:19.340
Oh, yeah!
Thank you for your help back there.

03:19.340 --> 03:21.150
Do you know him, Chloe?

03:21.150 --> 03:24.730
Yes! He visited our main branch
at Amande the other day,

03:24.730 --> 03:28.050
and I was in charge of guiding him!

03:28.430 --> 03:32.370
Is that so?
I can't believe you're a customer.

03:32.950 --> 03:35.220
I thank you for visiting our store.

03:35.740 --> 03:36.700
Yes.

03:37.140 --> 03:39.490
Thank you for your kindness.

03:39.490 --> 03:40.960
Hey.

03:42.720 --> 03:44.630
I'm Hiroaki Sakata.

03:45.290 --> 03:47.420
I'm what you call a hero.

03:47.420 --> 03:50.260
Sakata? Is he Japanese?

03:50.260 --> 03:53.340
So you're the rumoured Hero?

03:53.340 --> 03:54.670
In the flesh!

03:55.090 --> 03:59.420
I'm honoured to be able to meet
with the real Hero.

03:59.920 --> 04:03.190
My name is Haruto.
Pleasure to meet you.

04:03.780 --> 04:06.780
So you're also some kind of knight, huh?

04:06.780 --> 04:09.470
Nice fighting back there.

04:09.470 --> 04:12.320
Thank you. Still...

04:12.320 --> 04:17.340
You're all beings above the clouds,
it's making me nervous.

04:18.330 --> 04:23.330
Oh, to think someone
who beat that minotaur...

04:23.710 --> 04:26.270
...would be nervous of us?

04:28.580 --> 04:31.550
Looks like we'll be out of things to do
even when we're here.

04:31.550 --> 04:33.210
Flora, Roanna.

04:33.210 --> 04:35.460
Let's go somewhere safe.

04:35.790 --> 04:36.210
Sure.

04:36.210 --> 04:39.950
Is it the Hero's power
that allows him to speak fluently?

04:41.200 --> 04:42.290
Um...

04:43.820 --> 04:44.400
Flora!

04:44.400 --> 04:45.770
C-Coming!

04:48.810 --> 04:50.600
Did she notice me?

04:51.460 --> 04:55.070
Roanna seems fine,
but Princess Flora...

04:55.700 --> 04:57.050
Oh, well.

04:57.050 --> 04:58.950
Liselotte Cretia...

04:59.310 --> 05:02.300
I could become acquainted with
one of the powerful nobles in Galarc.

05:02.820 --> 05:06.050
Please allow me the opportunity to assist you.

05:06.050 --> 05:09.850
No, you don't have to go that far.

05:09.850 --> 05:10.920
For instance...

05:11.290 --> 05:12.410
That carriage...

05:13.060 --> 05:16.380
I might be able to fix it, if I may.

05:16.380 --> 05:19.020
That carriage?

05:19.020 --> 05:21.920
Then, at least let us confirm
the situation first.

05:21.920 --> 05:23.750
Aria, you come with me.

05:24.640 --> 05:25.850
Aria...

05:26.310 --> 05:27.340
She...

05:30.560 --> 05:32.770
We'll find Amande once we're out of the woods.

05:32.770 --> 05:36.770
Haruto, a big fight is happening over there.

05:37.820 --> 05:38.730
That's...

05:39.280 --> 05:40.330
Aria!

05:40.700 --> 05:41.950
Do you know her?

05:42.740 --> 05:43.700
Yeah.

05:43.700 --> 05:46.070
She was my friend at the Academy.

05:46.070 --> 05:48.520
She's wearing an outfit
from Ricca Guild.

05:48.520 --> 05:54.530
Oh, right. I heard Aria's serving
a princess of Duke Cretia.

06:00.300 --> 06:02.170
I sense a powerful demon.

06:11.100 --> 06:12.320
Aria!

06:12.320 --> 06:14.520
Aishia, take Master with you,

06:15.230 --> 06:17.700
and get somewhere safe.

06:17.700 --> 06:18.740
Got it.

06:19.370 --> 06:20.360
Huh? Rio!

06:26.110 --> 06:27.990
Please stand back.

06:34.580 --> 06:37.100
That was really excellent.

06:37.100 --> 06:39.030
It's all thanks to this sword.

06:39.030 --> 06:40.590
During the battle earlier,

06:40.990 --> 06:43.900
you seemed to be bending wind.

06:43.900 --> 06:45.220
I guess that's a curse sword?

06:45.830 --> 06:48.630
Not to mention,
an Enchanted Artifact Class one too...

06:48.630 --> 06:49.600
Yes.

06:50.340 --> 06:52.730
It's actually a spirit technique, though.

06:53.140 --> 06:56.230
Still, he's so strong and cool.

06:56.790 --> 07:01.110
How could you keep such a handsome
acquaintance to yourself, Chloe?

07:01.110 --> 07:02.740
You should introduce me to him later.

07:02.740 --> 07:05.870
We're not actually that close...

07:05.870 --> 07:11.180
Oh? Are you trying to hog him to yourself?

07:11.180 --> 07:13.200
No way...

07:13.200 --> 07:16.400
Cosette, you're troubling her.

07:16.400 --> 07:19.460
Oh, but aren't you curious as well, Natalie?

07:19.460 --> 07:21.090
That's...

07:21.090 --> 07:26.080
Besides, you're such a late bloomer
that no one will try to date you.

07:26.080 --> 07:27.100
Hey!

07:27.100 --> 07:31.310
I don't value love
based on numbers like you!

07:31.310 --> 07:33.530
All right, cut it out.

07:33.530 --> 07:35.790
Get the drinks to everyone as well.

07:43.090 --> 07:44.460
Lady Liselotte.

07:44.460 --> 07:47.220
It seems like the carriage's
temporary repairs are done.

07:48.550 --> 07:50.390
Thank you for waiting.

07:50.390 --> 07:53.470
I can't believe the carriage
has been revived like this...

07:53.470 --> 07:55.960
Thank you, Master Haruto.

07:55.960 --> 07:57.460
Master Haruto.

07:57.860 --> 07:59.920
Feel free to have a drink.

08:00.320 --> 08:01.650
It's a juice.

08:01.650 --> 08:06.690
I've made it a sweet blend just for you
to quench your thirst.

08:07.050 --> 08:11.010
Thank you.
I'll gladly take it.

08:11.010 --> 08:12.300
Um...

08:12.710 --> 08:15.460
I am a humble servant of Lady Liselotte.

08:15.460 --> 08:17.690
My name is Cosette, a maid.

08:17.690 --> 08:19.190
Thank you.

08:19.190 --> 08:20.690
Cosette.

08:20.690 --> 08:24.840
You're welcome.
I'll excuse myself then.

08:25.790 --> 08:28.630
The servants of Lady Liselotte...

08:28.630 --> 08:30.950
...are all interesting, I see.

08:30.950 --> 08:32.970
Interesting?

08:32.970 --> 08:35.770
I mean, thank you.

08:35.770 --> 08:36.580
Huh?

08:42.330 --> 08:46.410
Now, how do we move this?

08:46.410 --> 08:48.260
Out of the way.

08:48.690 --> 08:50.160
Observe.

09:08.950 --> 09:11.100
And that's that.

09:11.100 --> 09:12.820
It's nothing big, eh.

09:12.820 --> 09:15.290
That's our Hero.

09:16.180 --> 09:18.330
Such amazing magic...

09:27.810 --> 09:30.660
All right, time to depart, everyone!

09:36.460 --> 09:37.600
Um...

09:37.600 --> 09:42.560
Are you sure you want me
to hop on as well?

09:42.560 --> 09:45.070
There's no need to be so reserved.

09:45.070 --> 09:49.030
You're our life saviour, after all.

09:49.030 --> 09:50.550
Exactly.

09:50.550 --> 09:51.950
When we're at Amande,

09:52.390 --> 09:55.500
I'd like to reward you properly.

09:55.500 --> 09:59.580
No, you don't have to bow at me,
Lady Liselotte!

09:59.580 --> 10:01.270
Right...

10:02.320 --> 10:06.620
You're not one to easily bow at someone.

10:07.230 --> 10:09.280
My apologies.

10:09.280 --> 10:13.460
Well, you seem to possess basic etiquette.

10:13.460 --> 10:16.720
I, the Hero, will allow you to join us.

10:17.070 --> 10:18.540
It's an honour.

10:18.540 --> 10:21.980
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

10:23.450 --> 10:24.810
Right then...

10:25.540 --> 10:28.390
Today's lesson in Strahl language is over!

10:28.900 --> 10:31.530
Everyone's really improved!

10:31.530 --> 10:32.950
Yay!

10:33.340 --> 10:35.210
I really am brilliant!

10:35.210 --> 10:37.290
It's not you who's brilliant,

10:37.290 --> 10:40.390
it's the teacher's way of teaching
that's really good, isn't it?

10:40.390 --> 10:42.080
Oh, is that so?

10:43.710 --> 10:44.580
Masato!

10:44.580 --> 10:46.270
Let's go fishing!

10:46.270 --> 10:47.230
Yeah!

10:48.240 --> 10:51.050
Eh, what about spirit technique training?

10:51.460 --> 10:53.070
We'll do it another time!

10:53.070 --> 10:53.800
Ah...

10:54.150 --> 10:56.570
Honestly, always just playing around.

10:57.510 --> 11:02.560
Thanks to the magic tools, I can keep up
with the speed of the beastman children.

11:02.560 --> 11:04.490
It's just too much fun.

11:04.490 --> 11:05.940
Alright!

11:06.310 --> 11:10.710
Well, using magic tools is part
of learning spirit technique too, you know.

11:11.140 --> 11:13.790
So, you two, do your best with the training!

11:14.320 --> 11:15.350
Yes!

11:19.330 --> 11:22.260
Yes, focus on what's in front of you...

11:31.190 --> 11:32.270
Too bad.

11:32.270 --> 11:34.590
Sis Miharu, you're amazing.

11:34.590 --> 11:36.450
I'm just no good at all...

11:36.450 --> 11:38.300
No, that's not true...

11:38.780 --> 11:40.430
Why can't I do it?

11:40.820 --> 11:42.430
What's different?

11:43.370 --> 11:45.310
Maybe... talent...?

11:46.450 --> 11:48.810
Right, that's all for today.

11:48.810 --> 11:50.580
Well done, both of you.

11:50.940 --> 11:52.340
Shall we have some tea?

11:52.720 --> 11:53.470
Yeah.

11:53.470 --> 11:56.820
I'll just go for a little walk.

12:03.030 --> 12:04.450
Here.

12:04.450 --> 12:06.960
Hooray, it's dinner time!

12:09.600 --> 12:12.270
Here's your meal!

12:13.490 --> 12:15.170
Let's dig in!

12:16.850 --> 12:18.040
That was delicious!

12:18.530 --> 12:19.430
Seconds, please!

12:19.430 --> 12:22.330
No! Chew your food properly!

12:22.330 --> 12:23.660
Oh, come on.

12:23.660 --> 12:26.590
You have to listen to what "Mom" says.

12:27.140 --> 12:28.490
Haru!

12:28.490 --> 12:29.700
Mii...

12:30.180 --> 12:31.650
Well, I'm in trouble...

12:32.190 --> 12:34.650
Hey, let's play again sometime!

12:34.650 --> 12:35.340
Yeah.

12:35.340 --> 12:36.400
Promise!

12:36.400 --> 12:39.820
We'll always, always be together!

12:39.820 --> 12:40.740
Yes.

12:41.200 --> 12:43.200
No way!

12:43.200 --> 12:46.450
No, no! Don't go!

12:46.450 --> 12:49.870
Even though you promised
we'd always be together! Liar!

12:50.250 --> 12:52.380
Aki... I'm sorry...

12:52.770 --> 12:57.820
Big Brother, you're a liar!

13:02.410 --> 13:03.620
Aki?

13:05.020 --> 13:08.070
What's wrong?
All alone in a place like this...

13:08.070 --> 13:08.910
Oh...

13:09.430 --> 13:14.000
Well, there were some kids playing house,
and they looked so cute...

13:14.790 --> 13:16.640
Huh? They're not here...

13:16.640 --> 13:18.650
Maybe they've gone home already?

13:18.650 --> 13:20.450
Shall we head home too?

13:26.070 --> 13:28.630
Masato's late, isn't he?

13:28.630 --> 13:31.420
Perhaps they went off
to play somewhere far away.

13:31.420 --> 13:36.240
That Masato... When he first got here,
he was all nervous and jittery.

13:38.540 --> 13:41.060
Everything was so new and fascinating, right?

13:41.060 --> 13:44.680
Speaking of which, how did things go
with Latifa and Haruto back then?

13:47.280 --> 13:49.110
At first, well...

13:49.110 --> 13:51.690
It was a bit tough... I suppose.

13:51.690 --> 13:53.790
Tough, you say?

13:53.790 --> 13:58.190
I truly feel guilty about that time...

13:58.190 --> 14:02.740
I did tell you about the barrier around
the village that repels humans, didn't I?

14:02.740 --> 14:07.580
So, when Rio was camping there
and when we approached...

14:07.990 --> 14:11.720
We found Latifa, who was put
to sleep by spirit technique...

14:12.160 --> 14:16.510
We misunderstood, thinking a child from
our village had been kidnapped by a human.

14:16.510 --> 14:19.170
So, we ended up restraining Rio.

14:19.170 --> 14:20.210
What?

14:20.210 --> 14:24.410
My brother used
the spirit technique for my sake.

14:24.410 --> 14:27.900
At that time, I was often
plagued by nightmares...

14:28.630 --> 14:32.460
Once the misunderstanding was cleared up,
we hurried to rescue Rio.

14:32.460 --> 14:34.560
Now that you mention it,

14:34.560 --> 14:38.230
Rio seemed to be mumbling
something in his sleep...

14:38.230 --> 14:40.260
Ah... yes.

14:40.260 --> 14:42.900
He might have been crying a bit too.

14:42.900 --> 14:43.820
Eh...

14:44.370 --> 14:47.750
Um... what did my brother say?

14:47.750 --> 14:50.080
Um... I think it was...

14:50.530 --> 14:51.700
Mii...

14:52.430 --> 14:53.600
Mii.

14:54.450 --> 14:55.330
Eh?

14:56.830 --> 14:58.340
Mii...?

15:05.840 --> 15:07.460
I'm back!

15:08.740 --> 15:12.060
I caught this!
It's for dinner, a feast!

15:12.060 --> 15:12.970
Wow!

15:12.970 --> 15:14.390
It's huge!

15:25.360 --> 15:26.240
Yes?

15:27.510 --> 15:28.690
Good evening.

15:29.110 --> 15:32.120
Oh, I sense the presence of od and mana...

15:32.120 --> 15:34.940
Were you practising your spirit technique?

15:35.420 --> 15:37.120
Ah... yes.

15:37.500 --> 15:40.220
Miharu, you're always such a hard worker.

15:40.220 --> 15:41.500
It's nothing, really.

15:42.410 --> 15:44.690
What's going on with everyone all together?

15:45.120 --> 15:45.970
Actually...

15:46.410 --> 15:48.340
It's about Aki...

15:50.460 --> 15:53.370
Ah, it feels so good.

15:53.370 --> 15:53.970
Yes.

15:54.670 --> 15:57.110
Continuing the conversation from earlier...

15:57.110 --> 15:58.070
Yes?

15:58.070 --> 16:02.330
Latifa, what were you and Haruto
doing before you came here?

16:02.690 --> 16:03.480
Eh?

16:05.910 --> 16:09.110
Well, I...

16:09.110 --> 16:12.560
...was a slave for a noble
in the Beltrum Kingdom.

16:12.560 --> 16:15.010
A slave... What?

16:15.010 --> 16:18.050
A lot happened, but...

16:19.610 --> 16:23.180
...my brother freed me from slavery.

16:23.180 --> 16:25.830
And he brought me to this village...

16:27.010 --> 16:31.260
He said I could live peacefully here
with other beastman...

16:31.260 --> 16:32.460
Um...

16:33.010 --> 16:36.080
I'm sorry for asking
such a difficult question.

16:36.080 --> 16:37.520
No, it's alright.

16:38.220 --> 16:40.150
Because I got to meet my brother!

16:40.970 --> 16:43.210
All the hardships I faced,

16:43.210 --> 16:47.280
I now see them as the journey
leading me to meet him.

16:47.800 --> 16:52.030
So, now I want to help him in return.

16:52.460 --> 16:54.640
Your feelings...

16:54.640 --> 16:56.670
I understand them well.

16:57.190 --> 17:00.850
Have you ever been betrayed
by someone you adored as a child?

17:01.280 --> 17:03.330
I felt so sad and lonely...

17:03.730 --> 17:06.590
But then one day,
my mom remarried,

17:06.590 --> 17:09.810
...and I got a new older brother
and younger brother.

17:09.810 --> 17:12.510
That's Brother Takahisa and Masato.

17:12.900 --> 17:17.390
My elder brother was ever so kind
and always helping me with things...

17:17.790 --> 17:20.830
So I thought it was my turn to help...

17:21.540 --> 17:26.700
But I get frustrated because I can't use
the spirit technique properly...

17:27.040 --> 17:30.650
...or I feel upset when I remember the past...

17:31.020 --> 17:33.340
I end up always getting
angry with Masato.

17:33.340 --> 17:35.410
I feel completely useless...

17:35.820 --> 17:38.900
Aki, you're thinking about
so many things right now,

17:38.900 --> 17:41.600
and your heart's just all over
the place, isn't it?

17:43.340 --> 17:48.650
I know there're plenty of things to learn in your
new life, and it must be quite a handful, but...

17:49.200 --> 17:52.430
If you ever have worries like now,
just let me know.

17:52.830 --> 17:54.980
I'll listen to everything!

17:55.300 --> 17:57.310
Latifa...

17:57.310 --> 17:59.610
But... is that really alright?

17:59.610 --> 18:02.810
Of course! We're friends, after all!

18:02.810 --> 18:03.790
Right!

18:04.390 --> 18:05.180
Yeah.

18:06.890 --> 18:10.430
Ah, but I might only be able to listen, you know.

18:10.430 --> 18:12.950
That's perfectly fine.
It makes me happy.

18:13.330 --> 18:15.690
Thank you, Latifa.

18:21.060 --> 18:24.020
Looks like Aki is doing
morning practice again today.

18:24.020 --> 18:27.250
She's really been putting in
a lot of effort lately.

18:27.250 --> 18:28.860
So, shall we also...

18:39.880 --> 18:42.310
Oh, what's this smell?

18:42.860 --> 18:44.640
Good morning, Aki!

18:44.640 --> 18:46.640
Well done with your morning practice!

18:46.640 --> 18:48.180
Orphia!

18:48.180 --> 18:50.960
Hang on, is that... the uniform...?

18:50.960 --> 18:54.650
I borrowed Miharu's uniform.
Now I look pure, don't I?

18:54.650 --> 18:56.370
Ah... yes.

18:56.790 --> 18:58.800
You look wonderful, Orphia.

18:58.800 --> 18:59.920
Thank you!

18:59.920 --> 19:01.160
That must be nice...

19:01.160 --> 19:05.430
I wish my brother could
see me in that too.

19:05.430 --> 19:09.270
Isn't it a bit big for you, Latifa?

19:09.270 --> 19:10.630
In this area.

19:10.630 --> 19:12.500
Eh...

19:13.750 --> 19:15.760
But why the uniform...?

19:15.760 --> 19:20.090
I wanted to serve a special
breakfast in special clothes.

19:20.090 --> 19:22.190
A special breakfast...?

19:25.680 --> 19:27.400
It's apple pie!

19:27.870 --> 19:29.570
Looks delicious!

19:29.570 --> 19:31.530
I really love it!

19:31.940 --> 19:35.420
But why suddenly... special...?

19:35.840 --> 19:37.030
Huh?

19:37.390 --> 19:41.130
We all made it while you were
at morning practice.

19:41.130 --> 19:43.810
Miharu shared the recipe with us.

19:43.810 --> 19:47.780
We managed to bake it
just as nicely as Sis Miharu's does.

19:49.680 --> 19:51.550
Look, it's fresh out of the oven.

19:51.550 --> 19:53.780
Let's eat it while it's warm.

19:53.780 --> 19:56.300
Everyone... thank you!

19:58.830 --> 20:00.450
It's delicious!

20:00.450 --> 20:02.720
The tangy sweetness is irresistible, isn't it?

20:02.720 --> 20:05.850
Masato will be over the moon
when he wakes up.

20:06.230 --> 20:08.870
I want my brother to try this too!

20:08.870 --> 20:11.270
Yes, Haruto should definitely have some...

20:11.270 --> 20:12.230
That's right!

20:15.660 --> 20:16.900
What do you think?

20:16.900 --> 20:18.250
Adorable!

20:18.250 --> 20:19.910
It looks great on you!

20:20.320 --> 20:23.330
Aki, your uniform fits perfectly.

20:23.330 --> 20:26.000
Yeah! It's super cute!

20:27.300 --> 20:29.360
Thanks, Aki.

20:29.360 --> 20:34.020
When my brother gets back,
I want him to see me in this uniform too!

20:38.510 --> 20:42.470
PROXIA EMPIRE, IMPERIAL CAPITAL NIDGART

20:47.730 --> 20:48.960
EMPEROR NIDOLL PROXIA

20:48.960 --> 20:50.480
EMPEROR NIDOLL PROXIA
Hey, Nidoll.

20:50.480 --> 20:52.400
How's it going?

20:52.400 --> 20:53.940
Boring.

20:53.940 --> 20:57.190
Are you that itching to start a war?

20:58.770 --> 20:59.930
Well, whatever.

20:59.930 --> 21:04.870
I heard there's been some trouble
brewing in the Beltrum Kingdom.

21:04.870 --> 21:09.000
If Duke Arbor falls apart now,
that's going to be a bit of a pickle, isn't it?

21:10.410 --> 21:14.190
We've sent an envoy
as a gesture of goodwill.

21:14.190 --> 21:17.300
An internal squabble
won't change anything.

21:18.310 --> 21:21.430
You're putting in quite an effort
for a country we'll eventually crush.

21:21.430 --> 21:23.620
I've been looking for you, Lucius.

21:24.510 --> 21:29.620
Oh, speak of the devil,
the envoy's just turned up.

21:29.620 --> 21:33.150
Actually, I need your help.

21:33.570 --> 21:34.170
Eh?

21:34.660 --> 21:38.650
I'm thinking of finally
putting our plan into action,

21:39.830 --> 21:42.750
but there's this unexpected
factor in the mix.

21:42.750 --> 21:44.620
It's really quite bothersome...

21:45.020 --> 21:47.920
A Minotaur wouldn't stand
a chance against it.

21:47.920 --> 21:48.930
Oh...

21:48.930 --> 21:52.500
Well, we don't need
Sir Nidoll's assistance.

21:52.500 --> 21:54.890
Because he stand out too much.

21:56.000 --> 21:59.010
So, what exactly do you want me to do?

21:59.010 --> 22:02.010
It's a kidnap job.
The target is...

22:02.430 --> 22:06.330
Princess Flora Beltrum, the second
princess of the Beltrum Kingdom.

22:08.020 --> 22:09.500
Master Rio...

23:39.980 --> 23:40.860
NEXT EPISODE: THE INTRUDERS

23:40.860 --> 23:42.390
NEXT EPISODE: THE INTRUDERS
The Intruders.

23:42.390 --> 23:44.990
NEXT EPISODE: THE INTRUDERS

23:44.990 --> 23:46.890
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

23:46.890 --> 23:48.740
YAY!

